 n←{x}∆YesOrNo question;globalParms;parms;⎕TRAP
⍝ Modal dialog asking a yes-no question with "Yes" being the default button.
 :Access Public Shared
 ⎕TRAP←(#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiUtils.APLGuiError'C' '(⎕IO⊃⎕DM) ⎕SIGNAL ⎕en')(0 'N')
 x←{(0<⎕NC ⍵):⍎⍵ ⋄ ⍬}'x'
 (globalParms parms)←#._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo #._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiUtils.GetParms x
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiUtils.CheckTimeout globalParms parms
 :If 0∊⍴parms.autoPress
     parms.focusButton←0
 :Else
     parms.focusButton←parms.autoPress
 :EndIf
 parms.question{(0∊⍴⍵):⍺ ⋄ ⍵}←question
 parms.buttons←'Yes' 'No'
 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.CreateButtonForm globalParms parms
 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.HandleFocus n
 n(#._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.CreateAutoPressTimer)←parms.timeout
⍝Done
